B.M_=new A.jo("xPts","Expected points","How many FPL points we think a player will score.","Not a prediction of what will happen \u2014 an average of what would happen if the same fixture were played many times. A striker with 5.0 xPts might blank or haul; over a season, backing the higher number wins.","Per gameweek: under 3 is bench material, 4\u20135 is a solid starter, above 6 is premium.")
B.LX=new A.jo("FDR","Fixture Difficulty Rating","How hard a team's upcoming opponents are, from 1 to 5.","Green is easy, red is hard. It reflects the opponent's strength and whether the match is home or away \u2014 the same opponent is rated harder away from home.","1\u20132 is a good run, 3 is neutral, 4\u20135 is one to avoid or sell into.")
B.LV=new A.jo("FCPS","Free-hit, Chip and Point Swing","What a decision is worth, in points, against the best alternative.",'Everything is measured as a gap rather than a score: not "this squad rates 82/100" but "this squad is 14 points behind the best legal one". A gap can be checked afterwards; a score out of 100 cannot.',null)
B.LT=new A.jo("EO","Effective ownership","The share of rivals who will get points from a player this week.","Counts captaincy, so it can exceed 100%: a player owned by half your league and captained by all of them is 100% effective ownership. It is what decides whether a haul gains you rank or merely keeps you level.","Above 50% is a template pick \u2014 not owning him is the active risk.")
B.LU=new A.jo("xGI","Expected goal involvements","Expected goals and assists combined \u2014 chances created and taken.","Measures the quality of chances a player gets into, rather than whether they went in. It steadies faster than actual goals, so it spots form earlier and survives a cold finishing run.",null)
B.LW=new A.jo("PPG","Points per game","A player's average FPL points across the matches they played.","Ignores games missed, so it flatters someone who has been injured for most of the season. Read it next to minutes, not on its own.",null)
B.LS=new A.jo("GW","Gameweek","One round of Premier League fixtures, and one FPL scoring period.","Transfers and chips lock at the deadline, roughly 90 minutes before the first match of the round.",null)
B.LY=new A.jo("BGW","Blank gameweek","A round where some clubs have no fixture, so their players score 0.","Caused by cup competitions taking league dates. The usual answer is a Free Hit, or planning transfers a week or two ahead of it.",null)
B.LZ=new A.jo("DGW","Double gameweek","A round where some clubs play twice, so their players score twice.","The best week to use Bench Boost or Triple Captain, because every player involved gets two bites at the same chip.",null)
B.yw=new A.c_(B.TO,[B.M_,B.LX,B.LV,B.LT,B.LU,B.LW,B.LS,B.LY,B.LZ],A.aS("c_<k,jo>"))
